Add a --window <WindowServer id> option to rift-pip.

Upstream rift-pip only mirrors the currently focused Rift window. The
auto-PiP for Teams calls (~/.bin/rift-pip-auto) fires *after* the call's
workspace has been left, so the call window is no longer focused; this
patch lets the caller name the window instead. The lookup searches every
display's workspaces, so windows parked on inactive workspaces are found.

Made against acsandmann/rift-pip commit 06e15a6 (2026-09). Applied by
~/.bin/install-rift-pip.sh with `git apply`.

